    <h2>Protected assets</h2>
    <p>“Linxira”, “Linxira OS”, the Scale L mark, wordmarks, logos, icons, wallpapers, terminal character art, Plymouth artwork, welcome banners, and confusingly similar variations are Linxira brand assets.</p>
