    <h2>Zeta sub-brand mark</h2>
    <p>Zeta is the Linxira terminal coding agent. The LZ two-letter mark (L = Linxira, Z = Zeta) reuses the Scale L design language: near-black field, brightened teal strokes, and a coral block cursor. The two-letter form avoids colliding with single-letter Z marks used by other products (e.g. the GLM desktop CLI).</p>
    <p><img src="/assets/zeta-logo.svg" alt="Zeta LZ mark" style="height:5rem; width:auto;" /></p>
    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;">
      <tr style="background:rgba(32,184,176,0.08);">
        <th style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align:left; border:1px solid #263238; color:#20B8B0;">Asset</th>
        <th style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align:left; border:1px solid #263238; color:#e2e8f0;">SVG</th>
        <th style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align:left; border:1px solid #263238; color:#e2e8f0;">PNG / Icon</th>
      </tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; border:1px solid #263238; color:#94a3b8;">Zeta LZ mark (color)</td><td style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; border:1px solid #263238;"><a href="/assets/zeta-logo.svg">zeta-logo.svg</a></td><td style="padding:0.6rem 0.8rem; border:1px solid #263238;"><a href="/assets/zeta-logo.png">zeta-logo.png</a> (512px) · <a href="/assets/zeta-logo.ico">zeta-logo.ico</a></td></tr>
