      <li>Do not use the assets as the identity of another distribution, product, service, or organization.</li>
      <li>Do not modify the assets or imply official endorsement, certification, or affiliation.</li>
      <li>Do not register or claim rights in Linxira names, marks, or confusingly similar marks.</li>
      <li>Do not use the assets independently for commercial promotion or merchandise.</li>
    </ul>
